@Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059

### ==========================================
### PlatformAdmin Management Endpoints
### ==========================================

### 1. Create Platform Admin
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Super Admin",
  "email": "admin@uptrail.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

### 2. Get All Platform Admins (Returns 404 if no admins exist)
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin
Accept: application/json

### 3. Search Platform Admins by Name, Email, or Phone (Dedicated search endpoint)
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/search?searchTerm=nitinadmin@gmail.com
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search Platform Admins by Phone
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/search?searchTerm=7509
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Platform Admin By Id (Replace with actual GUID)
@adminId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/{{adminId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update Platform Admin By Id (Replace with actual GUID)
PUT {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/{{adminId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Super Admin Updated",
  "email": "admin@uptrail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1987654321",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/avatar-updated.jpg",
  "isEmailVerified": true,
  "isActive": true
}

### 5. Delete Platform Admin By Id (Replace with actual GUID)
DELETE {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/{{adminId}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### PlatformAdmin Auth Endpoints
### ==========================================

### 7. Platform Admin Login
# @name login
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdminAuth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nitinadmin@gmail.com",
  "password": "abcdefg"
}

### 7. Refresh Token
@refreshToken = your_refresh_token_here
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdminAuth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 8. Logout
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdminAuth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### ==========================================
### Role Management Endpoints
### ==========================================

### 9. Create Role (Requires valid CompanyId)
@companyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "name": "HR Manager",
  "isAdmin": false
}

### 10. Get All Roles (Returns 404 if no roles exist)
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get All Roles for a Company
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role?companyId={{companyId}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Roles by Company ID route
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role/company/{{companyId}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Search Roles
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role/search?searchTerm=Manager
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Role By Id
@roleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role/{{roleId}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Update Role By Id
PUT {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role/{{roleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Senior HR Manager",
  "isAdmin": false,
  "isActive": true
}

### 16. Delete Role By Id
DELETE {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Role/{{roleId}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### Company Management Endpoints
### ==========================================

### 17. Create Company
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Innovations Ltd",
  "email": "contact@acme.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "address": "123 Technology Park, Suite 400, Silicon Valley, CA",
  "website": "https://acme.com"
}

### 18. Get All Companies (Returns 404 if no companies exist)
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Company
Accept: application/json

### 19. Search Companies by Name, Email, Phone, or ID
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Company/search?searchTerm=Acme
Accept: application/json

### 20. Get Company By Id
@targetCompanyId = c1a11111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Company/{{targetCompanyId}}
Accept: application/json

### 21. Update Company By Id
PUT {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Company/{{targetCompanyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Uptrail Technologies Global",
  "email": "admin@uptrail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "address": "100 Innovation Way, Suite 500, Tech City, CA",
  "website": "https://uptrail.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### 22. Delete Company By Id (Soft delete; fails if company has active users/roles)
DELETE {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Company/{{targetCompanyId}}
Accept: application/json
